id: pm-jev-vouf
title: Detect existing duplicate items with calibrated pair decisions
description: "Calibrate links-only duplicate proposals with title/body/tag/file candidates, a fixed repository train/held-out split, precision-first train thresholds, and explicit unsure abstention. Report lexical-only, model-only and combined held-out metrics and the measured frontier, including sparse-label limitations. Work in plain-directory trackers; proposals never merge or close items."
type: Feature
pm_format_version: 2
status: closed
priority: 2
